{"4363260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BumSlayer", "steam_appid": 4363260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/8eb05b7bd0523534fdc38ce2db9747a9.avif?t=1778359009\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUM SLAYER</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>arena brawler / hack’n’slash</strong> with a satirical edge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a <strong>brutal difficulty curve</strong> that ramps up with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/4287e8a1d03872301a9565810aaebaf4.poster.avif?t=1778359009\" width=540 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/4287e8a1d03872301a9565810aaebaf4.webm?t=1778359009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/4287e8a1d03872301a9565810aaebaf4.mp4?t=1778359009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>arena</strong> and <strong>fight</strong> through relentless waves of <strong>dirty</strong> <strong>street</strong> <strong>bums</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and <strong>powerful</strong> <strong>bosses</strong> determined to stop <strong>you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>juicy, over-the-top, and unforgiving combat</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix brutal attacks with different fighting <strong>styles</strong> to push the <strong>mayhem</strong> even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/0d40860381cc955aab6c7efccedd2129.poster.avif?t=1778359009\" width=540 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/0d40860381cc955aab6c7efccedd2129.webm?t=1778359009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/0d40860381cc955aab6c7efccedd2129.mp4?t=1778359009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No <strong>MERCY</strong>. No <strong>BREAKS</strong>. Just <strong>PURE OLD-SCHOOL ACTION</strong>.  </i><br> <br><i>Enter the <strong>ARENA</strong>. Cleanse the <strong>STREETS</strong>. Bring forth a righteous fist of <strong>JUSTICE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i><strong>Become the BUM SLAYER.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/c8b48c8938c304e7c1219697296a4cab.poster.avif?t=1778359009\" width=424 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/c8b48c8938c304e7c1219697296a4cab.webm?t=1778359009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/c8b48c8938c304e7c1219697296a4cab.mp4?t=1778359009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master, rewarding combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visuals inspired by an early hardware era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique levels filled with bums to slay and 3 bosses to master and beat.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Info:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >music used in trailer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in hell by - David KBD</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/8eb05b7bd0523534fdc38ce2db9747a9.avif?t=1778359009\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUM SLAYER</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>arena brawler / hack’n’slash</strong> with a satirical edge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a <strong>brutal difficulty curve</strong> that ramps up with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/4287e8a1d03872301a9565810aaebaf4.poster.avif?t=1778359009\" width=540 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/4287e8a1d03872301a9565810aaebaf4.webm?t=1778359009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4363260/extras/4287e8a1d03872301a9565810aaebaf4.mp4?t=1778359009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>arena</strong> and <strong>fight</strong> through relentless waves of <strong>dirty</strong> <strong>street</strong> <strong>bums</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and <strong>powerful</strong> <strong>bosses</strong> determined to stop <strong>you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>juicy, over-the-top, and unforgiving combat</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix brutal attacks with different fighting <strong>styles</strong> to push the <strong>mayhem</strong> even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autop